{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の仕事帰り"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤さん家のまりかと一緒だったのですが、私のためにこんなものを描いてくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↓↓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、写真を載せようとしたら\n桜井の携帯ではBlogに載せられないらしいです(笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"申し訳ない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/3058053/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかさん載せてくれないかなー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/3058053/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/3058053/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/3058053/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に送られてきたこの2枚は\n普通に載せられるのに......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜだね(；￣Д￣）？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、今日の乃木坂浪漫"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"担当はわたくし桜井です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"太宰治 「女生徒」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また雰囲気が変わった感じに仕上がっていると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非checkしてみてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/3058053/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/05/3058053/0005.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}